/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Today, college students and young professional need more advocacy and support than ever before.  The facts are 87% of Gen Z have anxiety or lack career clarity and universities on average only offer 1 advisor for every 3,000 students. Traditionally, coaching has been expensive, not convenient and used more for corporate executives.  Our view is different at LifeRamp.  Our view is different at LifeRamp. Everyone deserves a coach by their side, and the earlier, the better, when significant life choices are made.)
/E (Today, college students and young professional need more advocacy and support than ever before.  The facts are 87% of Gen Z have anxiety or lack career clarity and universities on average only offer 1 advisor for every 3,000 students. Traditionally, coaching has been expensive, not convenient and used more for corporate executives.  Our view is different at LifeRamp.  Our view is different at LifeRamp. Everyone deserves a coach by their side, and the earlier, the better, when significant life choices are made.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [0]
>>
